{"data": [{"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:57:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118462766071878038"], "id": "2118462766071878038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1753, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Big question now is whether Sundar, Satya and Zuck are really AI pilled the way Sam and Dario are.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118462766071878038"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:29:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118448235689787900", "2118455698531205476"], "id": "2118455698531205476", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 12001, "like_count": 106, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118430684079407346", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is the same government that is talking about banning AI https://t.co/tziDyerYnJ", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2118455698531205476"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:04:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118449379694743667"], "id": "2118449379694743667", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1038, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Here's an updated chart of firms saying they are or are not changing the volume of employment or hiring due to AI.\n\nAmong firms using AI, the share of NOT CHANGING is about 87%-90%.\n\nAmong *all firms* (using AI or not), NOT CHANGING at least 95%-96%... https://t.co/3wjJDyND63", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2118449379694743667"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:59:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118448235689787900", "2118455698531205476"], "id": "2118448235689787900", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 14412, "like_count": 126, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 14}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118430684079407346", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is the same government that is taking about banning AI https://t.co/tziDyerqyb", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2118448235689787900"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:55:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118447241480560879"], "id": "2118447241480560879", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7980, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "My latest #MarketSnapshot video is now posted; recorded yesterday, so today’s rout is not discussed, but important messages in here nonetheless: https://t.co/CrEF494OFq", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2118447241480560879"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:53:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118446675052417153"], "id": "2118446675052417153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1480, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118425793558949907", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Heads up - the Census Bureau informed me that these questions are asked only of firms saying \"yes\" to using AI.\n\nSo the blue area (no impact on employment/hiring) is functionally much larger, and the orange/grey areas (increase or decrease) much smaller, than the chart shows https://t.co/pT9zrjfNdX", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2118446675052417153"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:51:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118446223120367781"], "id": "2118446223120367781", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1030, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118425793558949907", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Heads up - the Census Bureau informed me that these questions are asked only of firms saying \"yes\" to usin